{"id":"wb-1-75","name":"真觉寺金刚宝座（五塔寺塔）","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"真觉寺金刚宝座","text":"真觉寺金刚宝座，位于中华人民共和国北京市海淀区白石桥五塔寺村的真觉寺内，是中国境内现存时代最早的一座金刚宝座式塔。该塔始建于明代成化年间，曾于清代有过修缮。这座金刚宝座台基高7.7米，中有塔室可登至塔顶，塔顶有5座密檐式小塔。1961年，真觉寺金刚宝座被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9C%9F%E8%A7%89%E5%AF%BA%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E5%AE%9D%E5%BA%A7","revisionId":91614550,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91614550","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ce87f389b40a1f194b5e5ff4.jpg","title":"北京五塔寺塔2024.3_(cropped).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%A1%94%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%942024.3_(cropped).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%A1%94%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%942024.3_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​北京市海淀区 真觉寺金刚宝座（五塔寺塔）","width":320,"height":240}}